					<br><br><div class="largetext">See response to row 9 on each cover page hereto.

The securities reported on this Schedule 13G include an aggregate of 4,281,729 Class A Shares held by Ares Owners and an aggregate of 102,828,576 AOG Units held by Ares Owners. The general partner of Ares Owners is Ares Partners. Ares Partners is managed by a board of managers, which is composed of Michael J Arougheti, R. Kipp deVeer, David B. Kaplan, Antony P. Ressler and Bennett Rosenthal (each a "Board Member" and collectively, the "Board Members"). Mr. Ressler generally has veto authority over decisions of the Board Members. Based on information reported in Statements on Schedule 13G filed by, or information received from, the Board Members, the Class A Shares held by Ares Owners, if aggregated with other Class A Shares beneficially owned by each of the individual Board Members, would equal 112,079,605 Class A Shares in the aggregate, which includes (i) 102,828,576 shares that may be acquired upon the exchange of AOG Units held by Ares Owners and (ii) 2,125,000 Class A Shares issuable to certain of the Board Members upon the vesting of restricted stock units ("RSUs"), representing an aggregate of 33.7% of the outstanding Class A Shares (based on 227,372,228 outstanding Class A Shares as of June 30, 2026, as increased by (i) 102,828,576 Class A Shares issuable in respect of 102,828,576 AOG Units held by Ares Owners and (ii) 2,125,000 Class A Shares issuable to certain of the Board Members upon the vesting of RSUs).</div></td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter">(b)</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder">Percent of class:
